ous Bone Worm Organs.\n\nHe wants his Fumper back too.\n\nRequirements:\n - 1 x  ",["l"]=30},[45767]={["t"]="Elemental Cores",["x"]=6,["o"]="Collect 3 Fire Power Cores, 3 Water Power Cores, 3 Earth Power Cores, and 3 Air Power Cores.\nRequirements:\n - 3 x  \n - 3 x  \n - 3 x  \n - 3 x  ",["l"]=89},[11954]={["t"]="Striking Back",["x"]=11,["o"]="Slay the Glacial Templar summoned from the Ice Stone located near the Dark Portal in Hellfire Peninsula, then return to the Earthen Ring Elder in a capital city.\nRequirements:\n - 1 x  ",["l"]=88},[12466]={["t"]="Chasing Icestorm: The 7th Legion Front",["x"]=2,["o"]="Report to Legion Commander Tyralion at the 7th Legion Front in central Dragonblight.",["l"]=30},[12978]={["t"]="Facing the Storm",["x"]=2,["o"]="Bruor Ironbane at Bouldercrag's Refuge wants you to kill 10 Nidavelir Stormforged. You may kill Stormforged Champions, Stormforged Magi, or Stormforged War Golems.\nRequirements:\n - 10 x Nidavelir Stormforged slain",["l"]=30},[13490]={["x"]=0,["o"]="",["t"]="Honor the Flame"},[56007]={["x"]=0,["g"]="World Quest",["t"]="Runelocked Chest",["w"]=true,["o"]=""},[66958]={["t"]="Protect And Herd",["x"]=9,["o"]="Hunt down Bloodhorn east of Iskaara.\nRequirements:\n - 1 x  ",["l"]=70},[79246]={["x"]=0,["g"]="World Quest",["t"]="Captain's Orders: Coffer Collector",["w"]=true,["o"]=""},[24932]={["l"]=30,["t"]="Cutting Losses",["o"]="Kill 15 Hazzali Silithid of any kind in the Gaping Chasm.\nRequirements:\n - 15 x Hazzali Silithid slain",["x"]=0},[25956]={["t"]="Upon the Scene of Battle",["x"]=3,["o"]="Bring the broken shard back to the Legion's Rest.",["l"]=35},[26980]={["t"]="Swiftgear Station",["x"]=0,["o"]="Speak with Shilah Slabchisel at Swiftgear Station, north of Menethil Harbor.",["l"]=30},[30052]={["t"]="Weed War",["x"]=4,["o"]="Pull 100 weeds from Gai Lan's field.\n\nYou can pull weeds while mounted.\nRequirements:\n - 100 x Weeds pulled",["l"]=35},[31076]={["t"]="Fate of the Stormstouts",["x"]=4,["o"]="Ask the inhabita